        {
        }
        /**
         * Main execution workflow for the job with timing-based retry logic.
         *
         * Error Handling Strategy:
         * This method implements a dual-layer safety net to prevent silent failures:
         *
         * 1. Immediate Protection (try-catch wrapper):
         *    - Catches all exceptions and fatal errors during workflow execution
         *    - Treats caught errors as send failures and schedules retries
         *    - Prevents ActionScheduler from marking the job as failed without retry
         *
         * 2. Daily Safety Net (Maintenance Sweep):
         *    - A daily cron job scans for abandoned carts that should have received emails
         *    - Reschedules recovery emails for carts that fell through the cracks
         *    - Provides defense-in-depth against edge cases and unforeseen failures
         *
